    "summary": "Slip catalogue:\r\nEarthenware lime box (black) in shape and size somewhat like a large chestnut. It is round at the bottom, but the top is slightly flatter and contains a small aperture. Round the aperture and radiating from it are five bands of incised lines terminating in a circular band of similar design. Each of the interspaces has two rows of small punctures.",
